(7566906, 1213804, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that fully meets the challenge brief		<br/> <br/>Reflections are always gonna appeal to me and this does just that. Your title is quite apt its vitality does make it feel somewhat metallic. You dont need to know what it is a reflection of the random nature of the waters surface breaks it up into something that takes on a life of its own to become another interesting transformation. Very nice Janine, well done</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that fully meets the challenge brief		 Reflections are always gonna appeal to me and this does just that. Your title is quite apt its vitality does make it feel somewhat metallic. You dont need to know what it is a reflection of the random nature of the waters surface breaks it up into something that takes on a life of its own to become another interesting transformation. Very nice Janine, well done', '2018-04-24 14:17:31.000000', NULL, 0);
